OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged after city centre
OL,4,Adisturbance
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith an incident in a city centre.
OL,9,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,10,Fwere called to reports of a violent
OL,11,Fdisturbance involving numerous people
OL,12,Fin Calenick Street, Truro, Cornwall, at
OL,13,F13:45 BST on Monday. A man was
OL,14,Fhospitalised with injuries later deemed
OL,15,Fnon-life-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
