OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged after city centre
OL,4,Adisturbance
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinjar Zurel, 27, and Seyin Zurel, 24,
OL,7,Ffrom Malpas, Truro, had been charged
OL,8,Fwith two counts of causing grievous
OL,9,Fbodily harm with intent; with Sinjar
OL,10,FZurel also charged with assault
OL,11,Foccasioning actual bodily harm and
OL,12,Fpossession of a knife blade/sharp
OL,13,Fpointed article in public, police said.
OL,15,FThe men were in custody and due before
OL,16,FTruro Magistrates' Court on Wednesday,
OL,17,Fthey added.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
